d file structure\n- Configuration alignment with paper\n- File structure diagrams\n- Quality assurance checklist\n- Deployment guide\n\n**Read this** to understand all changes made.\n\n### 5. Verification Checklist\n**File**: `STD-MAE_VERIFICATION_CHECKLIST.md`\n- File-by-file verification matrix\n- Hyperparameter alignment table\n- Integration verification\n- Compatibility testing results\n- Complete verification summary\n\n**Read this** to validate correctness.\n\n### 6. Documentation Index\n**File**: `STD-MAE_DOCUMENTATION_INDEX.md`\n- Navigation guide for all documents\n- Document quick reference\n- Usage scenarios\n- File location reference\n- Troubleshooting navigation\n\n**Read this** to find what you need.\n\n---\n\n## Configuration Files Status\n\n### Main Configuration (UPDATED)\n**Location**: `Bigscity-LibCity/libcity/config/model/traffic_state_pred/STDMAE.json`\n- **Status**: ✓ UPDATED AND VERIFIED\n- **Parameters**: 39 (optimized from 54)\n- **Changes**: Removed redundancies, corrected schedule, added pre-training params\n- **Ready**: YES\n\n### Model Implementation (VERIFIED)\n**Location**: `Bigscity-LibCity/libcity/model/traffic_speed_prediction/STDMAE.py`\n- **Status**: ✓ VERIFIED\n- **Lines**: 867 (T-MAE, S-MAE, GraphWaveNet)\n- **Changes**: None needed\n- **Ready**: YES\n\n### Task Configuration (VERIFIED)\n**Location**: `Bigscity-LibCity/libcity/config/task_config.json`\n- **Status**: ✓ VERIFIED\n- **STDMAE Registration**: Line 100 (in allowed_model)\n- **Task Config**: Lines 538-542\n- **Changes**: None needed\n- **Ready**: YES\n\n### Dataset Configuration (VERIFIED)\n**Location**: `Bigscity-LibCity/libcity/config/data/TrafficStatePointDataset.json`\n- **Status**: ✓ VERIFIED\n- **Compatible Datasets**: 40+\n- **Changes**: None needed\n- **Ready**: YES\n\n---\n\n## Key Statistics\n\n| Metric | Value |\n|--------|-------|\n| Configuration Parameters | 39 (optimized) |\n| Removed Redundant Params | 15 |\n| Corrected Params | 3 |\n| Added Missing Par