ble ranges based on paper and GNN best practices\n   - Consider grid search for discrete params, random/bayesian for continuous\n\n## Output Requirements\nProvide a structured search space specification including:\n- Parameter names and ranges\n- Search strategy (grid, random, bayesian)\n- Expected number of trials\n- Rationale for each parameter choice\n- Baseline configuration to compare against\n\nBe thorough in your analysis but concise in your recommendations."}
